{"parentUuid":"3024c39a-b61f-4dfd-bb38-456df8b5b8d1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgMsRnWMbTVsstPW9Fhbs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've pushed a CI fix to #355 and it is waiting on the last two test suites. #358 is also still running. I'll report back when the results arrive.\n\n- **Failure on #355:** the pinned installer can't install actionlint, so the tests that lint workflows had no linter.\n- **Fix:** a small local action, `install-workflow-linters`, now installs zizmor and actionlint from a checksummed release. The test and coverage jobs both use it. Coverage passes on #355 now.\n- **Stacking:** none of the PRs is stacked and all target `main`. I checked five of the pairs (#353/#354, #354/#356, #353/#356, #356/#358, #354/#355) and none conflict, so they can merge in any order.\n- **Ready for you:** #353, #354, #356 and #357 are clean and non-draft."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":566,"cache_read_input_tokens":110126,"output_tokens":272,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":566,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":272,"cache_read_input_tokens":110126,"cache_creation_input_tokens":566,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":566},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"d0f82254-7f85-41bb-b614-d01285a5da55","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgMsRnDVHMHM51h9LfXpP","requestRef":"81314094-bd9d-4ddf-9897-a520c9ded789","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"f596cdbd-279b-443a-897c-9