{"parentUuid":"fbc13b62-eded-43ad-9c4b-c63e3287590f","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e05639b3-9150-41dd-8002-a9fd8a53af89","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01F6FfWnPJbz2URjDg3YT4uA","type":"tool_result","content":"290\t/// Extracts `[package].name` from an already-parsed `Cargo.toml` document.\n291\t/// Pure and I/O-free -- operates on a document the caller already has,\n292\t/// whether that's a fully-opened [`CargoToml`] (via [`Manifest::package_name`])\n293\t/// or a bare parse a caller made for some other purpose entirely (e.g.\n294\t/// [`crate::read_identity`], which needs only a package name and deliberately\n295\t/// does not go through the full [`CargoToml::open`] lifecycle).\n296\tpub fn cargo_package_name(doc: &toml_edit::DocumentMut) -> Option<&str> {\n297\t    doc.get(\"package\").and_then(|p| p.get(\"name\")).and_then(|n| n.as_str())\n298\t}\n299\t\n300\t/// Rewrites a dependency entry's `version` to `new_str`, preserving decor\n301\t/// across the three shapes Cargo allows for a dependency value: a bare\n302\t/// version string, an inline table with a `version` key, or a full\n303\t/// `[dependencies.name]` table with a `version` key. `Err(())` for any\n304\t/// other shape -- callers map that to their own\n305\t/// `ManifestError::UnrecognizedDependencyValue` (which needs a `path` this\n306\t/// function has no access to). Shared by the member-manifest\n307\t/// ([`CargoToml::update_dependency_spec`]) and workspace-root\n308\t/// ([`WorkspaceCargoResolver::write_dependency`]) dependency-write paths,\n309\t/// which were previously two copies of this exact three-shape dance,"}]},"uuid":"b7c52466-6c37-404c-9ae3-7e7cb4c8b3c3","timestamp":"2026-10-24T23:38:34.783Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/crates/callisto-manifests/src/cargo.rs","content":"/// Extracts `[package].name` from an already-parsed `Cargo.toml` document.\n/// Pure and I/O-free -- operates on a document the caller already has,\n/// whether that's a fully-opened [`CargoToml`] (via [`Manifest::package_name`])\n/// or a bare parse a caller made for some other purpose entirely (e.g.\n/// [`crate::read_identity`], which needs only a package name and deliberately\n/// does not go through the full [`CargoToml::open`] lifecycle).\npub fn cargo_package_name(doc: &toml_edit::DocumentMut) -> Option<&str> {\n    doc.get(\"package\").and_then(|p| p.get(\"name\")).and_then(|n| n.as_str())\n}\n\n/// Rewrites a dependency entry's `version` to `new_str`, preserving decor\n/// across the three shapes Cargo allows for a dependency value: a bare\n/// version string, an inline table with a `version` key, or a full\n/// `[dependencies.name]` table with a `version` key. `Err(())` for any\n/// other shape -- callers map that to their own\n/// `ManifestError::UnrecognizedDependencyValue` (which needs a `path` this\n/// function has no access to). Shared by the member-manifest\n/// ([`CargoToml::update_dependency_spec`]) and workspace-root\n/// ([`WorkspaceCargoResolver::write_dependency`]) dependency-write paths,\n/// which were previously two copies of this exact three-shape dance,","numLines":20,"startLine":290,"totalLines":1087}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"fbc13b62-eded-43ad-9c4b-c63e3287590f","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"fix/first-release-metadata","slug":"lexical-jingling-puppy"}
