{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","hash":"af8dbf6232b815ca178fc1c340a27433a0f7f738ba070423cd186eeffe0a57ee","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01KDfDgD7ShBNvnxGUKjuce8","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/claude-501/body-root.md","content":"A repository whose packages all sit in subdirectories, with no manifest at the top, stopped every command with E030, including `init`.\n\nA `callisto.toml` now marks the workspace root like a workspace manifest does. `init` falls back to the Git root when it finds none, writes `callisto.toml`, and so roots the repository from then on. An empty repository with no packages still reports E030, whose help now names `callisto init` and `callisto.toml`.\n\nTests: root detection with and without the marker, `init` rooting a subdirectory-only repository, and `init` still refusing an empty one.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01F7zCpmAh1rPrgucZcuchi6","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main && zsh /tmp/claude-501/ship.sh feat/callisto-toml-roots-workspace origin/main \"feat(init): set up a repository with no manifest at its top\" /tmp/claude-501/body-root.md \"Treat callisto.toml as a workspace marker and let init root a repository whose manifests are all in subdirectories.\" . 2>&1 | tail -2","description":"Commit, push and open the PR","dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
