{"parentUuid":"558ba9cd-cdc8-4c18-9411-c863147872f4","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01EEdHKodVyYMVtZbgKEEtUS","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"19a0e660-048c-4033-b00a-59dcfaa9be4d","timestamp":"2026-10-25T00:15:25.884Z","session_id":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"feat/callisto-toml-roots-workspace","slug":"lexical-jingling-puppy"}
{"parentUuid":"19a0e660-048c-4033-b00a-59dcfaa9be4d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgMzU2EUBmUYwLBBZMZt3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Answering your question: no, I hadn't been stacking correctly, and it's fixed now.\n\n**Stacking:** #360, #361 and #363 are now a native GitHub stack (#360 → #361 → #363, with #360 targeting `main`). #361 and #363 had a real overlap in `docs/errors.md`, `error.rs` and the init tests. I merged each branch into the one above it and pushed with no force-push. The tests passed on #361, and `just ci` passed on #363 after the merge, so the merge fix is verified. #359 touches different files, so it stays independent on `main`.\n\n**What's open for you to merge:**\n\n| PR | What it does |\n| --- | --- |\n| #359 | Release notes no longer cut short by code blocks or a byte order mark (independent) |\n| #360 | First crates.io release without a description or license stops with E323 (stack bottom) |\n| #361 | Bad `snapshot --tag` stops with E324; `init` says when the defaults apply |\n| #363 | `callisto.toml` marks the workspace root, so `init` works on repos with no top-level manifest |\n\nMerge #360, #361, #363 in that order, then retarget and merge as GitHub prompts.\n\n**Dropped:** the E121 message item. I couldn't reproduce it in the new-user flow, so I didn't build it.\n\n**Remaining:** Python `~=` precision and Poetry comment loss. I'll reproduce each before building, and I'm skipping them if I can't.\n\nresult: Opened a native three-PR stack (#360, #361, #363) plus independent #359, covering the first-release metadata check, snapshot tag validation, init polish and rooting repos with no top-level manifest; CI passes locally."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":483,"cache_read_input_tokens":272095,"output_tokens":562,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":483,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":562,"cache_read_input_tokens":272095,"cache_creation_input_tokens":483,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":483},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"f9718b3d-dddb-4c63-8047-aef646813b06","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgMzU1seY6jw6xjgxoa9j","requestRef":"10ec739e-1e77-44ba-be5d-bee7ec3ad632","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"2d254ade-4ebc-4aca-85b4-79313a8ce2e1","timestamp":"2026-10-25T00:15:25.883Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"feat/callisto-toml-roots-workspace","slug":"lexical-jingling-puppy"}
