{"type":"file-history-delta","messageId":"7f582200-33d7-4915-8bcc-b297efe3a396","snapshotMessageId":"84f53f9b-d7fd-4c72-9d33-a9b658e64b78","trackingPath":"/tmp/claude-501/body-patience.md","backup":{"backupFileName":null,"version":1,"backupTime":"2026-10-25T02:51:37.949Z","realParentDir":"/private/tmp/claude-501"},"timestamp":"2026-10-25T02:51:37.950Z"}
{"parentUuid":"3af4f624-67a4-4ec0-8f9f-1340533a1338","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgNCNr6HWtD4fquAEZAhq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PKZXVk2j8uVpp1jAvyHuTB","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/claude-501/body-patience.md","content":"With the network down, `release --dry-run` on 10 crates took 61 seconds to print its plan. The wait was the registry name check, which is advisory and was waiting out the full retry schedule that the checks a release depends on use.\n\nThe name check now waits at most one second between its own tries: one retry past a transient failure, then it reports nothing and the plan comes out. The same run takes 2.8 s. The checks a release depends on keep the full schedule.\n\nTest hermeticity: the local-release unit tests ran a real `cargo info` against crates.io. Their git runner now answers a registry lookup as an unpublished crate would. A new test pins that an unreachable registry costs the name check exactly one retry and does not stop the plan.\n\nStacked on the batched-history PR.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":619,"cache_read_input_tokens":389257,"output_tokens":622,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":619,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":622,"cache_read_input_tokens":389257,"cache_creation_input_tokens":619,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":619},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01PKZXVk2j8uVpp1jAvyHuTB":{"file_path":"/t