{"parentUuid":"cd19df7d-7a39-47ec-b36d-90a13540b9f1","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01Y6Jc4DnvqGFs2uCKaYeZEc","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"7368a965-b354-40b1-94e8-89ed3a549c15","timestamp":"2026-10-25T02:52:10.861Z","session_id":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"fix/advisory-check-patience","slug":"lexical-jingling-puppy"}
{"parentUuid":"7368a965-b354-40b1-94e8-89ed3a549c15","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgNCRLrU98XSJYZimed4N","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"PR #367 is open and stacked on #364 and #365: https://github.com/orin-dx/callisto/pull/367. It fixes a 61-second stall in `release --dry-run` when the network is down. The same run now prints its plan in 2.8 s. `just ci` passed locally.\n\n- **The stall:** I blackholed the network and ran `release --dry-run` on 10 crates. The wait was the registry name check, which is advisory but waited out the full retry schedule.\n- **The fix:** that check now allows one retry past a transient failure, then reports nothing and the plan comes out. The checks a release depends on keep the full schedule.\n- **Test hermeticity:** the local-release unit tests were running a real `cargo info` against crates.io, which I introduced in #354. Their git runner now answers a registry lookup as an unpublished crate would. A new test pins that an unreachable registry costs exactly one retry.\n\n**Open PRs:**\n- Stack #366: #364 (parallel lookups) → #365 (batched history) → #367 (advisory patience)\n- The release PR #349\n\n**Cargo lookups:** ADR 4 makes ecosystem tools own registry reads and auth, so I'm leaving `cargo info` alone. It's the remaining ~100 ms per crate. A direct crates.io read would need a new ADR from you, so I'm not building it.\n\n**Next:** I'm testing offline, bad-auth and half-failed-release behavior on the real tool paths.\n\nresult: PR #367 opened, stacked on #364 and #365, cutting the offline release --dry-run stall from 61 s to 2.8 s and removing real-network calls from unit tests, with full local CI passing."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":997,"cache_read_input_tokens":389876,"output_tokens":555,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":997,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":555,"cache_read_input_tokens":389876,"cache_creation_input_tokens":997,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":997},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"b251cb95-9b90-48b5-b43f-f185d4b7eec7","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgNCRLXsvxjLMj9Hw9F6u","requestRef":"4d403e3b-7b89-4394-88de-caebaf517fb3","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"e65bced6-5a1b-4c96-9e56-05c69b60fd7f","timestamp":"2026-10-25T02:52:10.860Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"fix/advisory-check-patience","slug":"lexical-jingling-puppy"}
