{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","hash":"8bd2beb07e8eb98f8fca5631ac0f424faf59363debfd27698ac949980411db1e","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WovbDLLHt61Zk8HK5c5F8C","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/claude-501/body-relverify.md","content":"Every Release run on `main` since the CI hardening change has failed in \"Verify release candidate\", so no release PR has been created or updated. The job runs `just test`, and the tests that lint generated workflows now fail without zizmor and actionlint; only the CI workflow installed them.\n\nThe verify job installs them with the same local action CI uses. A new workflow contract check fails any workflow that runs `just test` or `just coverage` without that action, so the next such workflow cannot ship without them. Checked by removing the step: the contract fails with the workflow's name.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EbyRFPri3U2XqLKfGuYK2W","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main && zsh /tmp/claude-501/ship.sh ci/release-verify-linters origin/main \"ci(release): install the workflow linters in the release verify job\" /tmp/claude-501/body-relverify.md \"Install the workflow linters in the release verify job and fail any workflow that runs tests without them.\" . 2>&1 | tail -2","description":"Commit, push and open the PR","dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
