{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","hash":"c50697f3adcfa17c2b821996241862e25f0f3bbaacfc18dd09bbbd83fa392064","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'll add the `features-boundary` guard and hygiene job to CI, since `semver-checks` should only run on release PRs (to avoid failing normal PRs for API additions).\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01U22c6hECUgQ1p1fYdgQYPJ","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/justfile","old_string":"# Run unused dependency check via cargo-machete","new_str":"# The shipped binary is built with the features its crates default to, and none of them is the dev-only `test-util`.\nfeatures-boundary:\n    ! cargo tree -p callisto-cli -e normal,build -f '{p} {f}' | grep 'test-util'\n\n# Run unused dependency check via cargo-machete"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FaFDJJXcGNDSdx36gQYfjr","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/.github/workflows/callisto-ci.yml","old_string":"      # Non-blocking for now: the workspace-total gate above can pass while\n      # a small crate is far below threshold (a few large crates dominate\n      # the total line count). Visible in logs so regressions get noticed;\n      # promote to a required check once existing per-crate gaps are closed.\n      - run: just coverage-per-crate 90 || echo \"::warning::one or more crates below 90% line coverage (non-blocking, see job log above)\"\n","new_str":"      # The workspace total can pass while a small crate is far below threshold, because a few large crates dominate\n      # the line count, so each crate is held to the same floor.\n      - run: just coverage-per-crate 90\n\n  hygiene:\n    name: Dependency & API Hygiene\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    timeout-minutes: 45\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@3d3c42e5aac5ba805825da76410c181273ba90b1 # v7.0.1\n        with:\n          fetch-depth: 0\n          persist-credentials: false\n      - uses: taiki-e/install-action@1168f6810a3cb30a3514bf5756a3b7f0422c6df8 # v2\n        with:\n          tool: just@1.58.0,cargo-machete,cargo-semver-checks\n      - uses: orin-dx/actions/setup-rust@2521888266780dabc7f5fd4c32b02d6ab82849db # v1.1\n      - run: just machete\n      - run: just features-boundary\n      # A version only moves on the release PR, so that is where the public API is compared with the published one.\n      - if: github.head_ref == 'callisto/version-packages'\n        run: just check-api\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01F95zjcpTawrF2yfuZ1aP5f","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main && just features-boundary > /dev/null 2>&1; echo boundary-exit=$?; zizmor --offline .github/workflows/callisto-ci.yml 2>&1 | tail -2; actionlint .github/workflows/callisto-ci.yml 2>&1 | grep -v '\\$/' | head -5; just workflow-contracts > /dev/null 2>&1; echo contracts-exit=$?","description":"Check the new recipe and workflow lint/contracts","dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true,"timeout":600000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
