{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","hash":"6b57f2142fde1c4802d1d7dbe098c0122f8b9a4d36647af7b808956f60aa9b5d","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VPL52MExyhPrj3Kyd9Yah5","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/claude-501/body-hyg.md","content":"CI now enforces three checks that existed as recipes but ran by hand, and `callisto-manifests` gains the tests it needed to pass the per-crate coverage gate.\n\n- Unused dependencies: `cargo machete` runs in CI. It found `camino` and `thiserror` unused in `callisto-manifests`; both are removed.\n- Shipped features: `just features-boundary` fails if the dev-only `test-util` feature appears anywhere in `callisto-cli`'s build, so the published binaries cannot carry it. They carry every other feature their crates default to.\n- Public API: `cargo semver-checks` runs on the release PR, where versions have moved, and compares the public API with the published one. On an ordinary PR a version has not moved, so any addition would fail it.\n- Per-crate coverage is now blocking at 90%. `callisto-manifests` was at 89.2%, so it gets tests for the behavior that decides what ships, not for the number: which `publish` values make a crate publishable, `private` and `publishConfig` in `package.json`, a truncated `package.json`, missing and invalid name and version, the workspace version with and without a byte order mark and when invalid, and the refusal to update optional Cargo dependencies. It is now at 90.7%.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WdFqonHTzHKbQmMXUpV6xx","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main && zsh /tmp/claude-501/ship.sh ci/gate-machete-semver origin/main \"ci: gate on unused dependencies, shipped features, public API and per-crate coverage\" /tmp/claude-501/body-hyg.md \"Run machete, a shipped-features guard, semver-checks on the release PR and a blocking per-crate coverage gate; remove two unused dependencies.\" . 2>&1 | tail -2","description":"Commit, push and open the PR","dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
