{"parentUuid":"0c0e76a7-efa0-4b2e-88e0-f337e10d378b","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"fbb155ba-b167-49bf-8715-f1b81bf02c2f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RF1RBEGxccmvcEaNKJwgVh","type":"tool_result","content":"323:249 numeric E#### codes total in one registry.\n28:- CI releases based on the merged release PR retain the original package list.\n38:- **Simple shape** (no artifact slots or napi platform packages): `version-pr` maintains the release PR. On each default-branch push, `release` runs `callisto release`; it is a no-op until an untagged version is merged.\n39:- **Build-matrix shape** (artifact slots or napi platform packages): a release PR, then plan -> build -> publish. The build covers configured targets and artifact slots.\n51:The default branch is the approval boundary: a merge to it publishes. Protect it with a rule that requires pull requests and reviews (GitHub -> Settings -> Rules). Init prints this reminder after writing the file.\n67:The generated workflow keeps a release PR current. Merging that PR to the protected default branch authorizes publication; Callisto adds no approval step. Require reviews and CI checks in branch protection. A CODEOWNERS file alone does not enforce review.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"3805b0e9-693f-414a-b29e-1de79c74c17f","timestamp":"2026-10-25T16:39:04.223Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"323:249 numeric E#### codes total in one registry.\n28:- CI releases based on the merged release PR retain the original package list.\n38:- **Simple shape** (no artifact slots or napi platform packages): `version-pr` maintains the release PR. On each default-branch push, `release` runs `callisto release`; it is a no-op until an untagged version is merged.\n39:- **Build-matrix shape** (artifact slots or napi platform packages): a release PR, then plan -> build -> publish. The build covers configured targets and artifact slots.\n51:The default branch is the approval boundary: a merge to it publishes. Protect it with a rule that requires pull requests and reviews (GitHub -> Settings -> Rules). Init prints this reminder after writing the file.\n67:The generated workflow keeps a release PR current. Merging that PR to the protected default branch authorizes publication; Callisto adds no approval step. Require reviews and CI checks in branch protection. A CODEOWNERS file alone does not enforce review.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true},"classifierBoundary":true,"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"2780a6a4-d9b0-4265-998a-07e93de38537","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","branch":"docs/refresh-readme-contributing","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"0c0e76a7-efa0-4b2e-88e0-f337e10d378b","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"docs/refresh-readme-contributing","slug":"lexical-jingling-puppy"}
