{"parentUuid":"249cfa7f-cf3c-4f25-9ffa-c68ad4c3f95f","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"fbb155ba-b167-49bf-8715-f1b81bf02c2f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WNzaxK34ZvZzAbCqDScPB9","type":"tool_result","content":"release                                                 decision -> intent -> envelope -> execute_release -> receipt\n  per operation                                         observe provider -> adopt, or perform and confirm\n```\n\nPackage ordering, cycle reports and release-operation readiness all run on `michi-graph` (validation reports every problem at once; edge kinds are chosen per validation). Git access goes through `GitAccess` (`callisto_model::vcs`).\n\nDepth:","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"14c36596-95f0-43da-82bb-ab328eb02e4c","timestamp":"2026-10-25T16:39:43.751Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"release                                                 decision -> intent -> envelope -> execute_release -> receipt\n  per operation                                         observe provider -> adopt, or perform and confirm\n```\n\nPackage ordering, cycle reports and release-operation readiness all run on `michi-graph` (validation reports every problem at once; edge kinds are chosen per validation). Git access goes through `GitAccess` (`callisto_model::vcs`).\n\nDepth:","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"a3e7b168-9b4a-4056-830c-f2ef535d27c0","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","branch":"docs/refresh-readme-contributing","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":3,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remot