{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","hash":"7f10bdbd713141fb0e7838855d327dd2413702c67d85fdb90c9790421f878271","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Fixtures are in place, so I'll write property tests over random dependency graphs to verify key invariants: dependency ranges stay covered post-cascade, affected dependents get bumped, versions never regress, seeded severities never lower, and results stay deterministic.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01RrPQjcoQabQuThNHCdRKRY","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main && tail -5 crates/callisto-graph/src/cascade/tests.rs; grep -n \"make_dep_edge(\" crates/callisto-graph/src/cascade/tests.rs | head -2; grep -n \"derive\" -A1 crates/callisto-graph/src/cascade.rs | sed -n 1,12p; grep -n \"pub enum Severity\" -B3 crates/callisto-model/src/*.rs | head -6; grep -n \"pub fn semver\" crates/callisto-model/src/version.rs","description":"Check derives and helper usage needed by the property test","dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
